WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.012
[MUSIC]

00:00:03.012 --> 00:00:06.277
The world of the chief financial
officer has changed dramatically.

00:00:06.277 --> 00:00:10.819
It used to be about technical expertise,
being a great accountant.

00:00:10.819 --> 00:00:14.368
Now CEOs need to make strategic
financial decisions and

00:00:14.368 --> 00:00:16.716
in a changing dynamic environment.

00:00:16.716 --> 00:00:21.637
They need to know how to become
truly effective leaders.

00:00:21.637 --> 00:00:28.469
[MUSIC]

00:00:28.469 --> 00:00:32.085
&gt;&gt; I needed of course that could
help me to become a better CFO.

00:00:32.085 --> 00:00:36.360
&gt;&gt; The ability to become more engaged in
financial matters with our company was

00:00:36.360 --> 00:00:38.311
an opportunity for advancement.

00:00:38.311 --> 00:00:42.771
&gt;&gt; We expose the participants to experts
at the Stanford Graduate School of

00:00:42.771 --> 00:00:43.510
Business.

00:00:43.510 --> 00:00:49.770
Who have done research in the area of
leadership, as well as strategic thinking.

00:00:49.770 --> 00:00:53.769
The participants, by engaging with these
experts as well as amongst themselves.

00:00:53.769 --> 00:00:57.852
Will be able to learn these
attributes in a way that

00:00:57.852 --> 00:01:02.370
helps accelerate their
path to becoming the CFO.

00:01:02.370 --> 00:01:07.370
&gt;&gt; I've moved from the technical aspects
of being a finance professional,

00:01:07.370 --> 00:01:08.759
to a strategic partner.

00:01:09.760 --> 00:01:13.725
And I was looking for a class that
would help me jump to the next level.

00:01:13.725 --> 00:01:19.149
&gt;&gt; This program brings finance leaders up
to date with what's happening right now.

00:01:19.149 --> 00:01:21.892
And how to make financial
decisions much more effectively.

00:01:21.892 --> 00:01:26.375
We want the participants to gain a greater
understanding of current trends in finance

00:01:26.375 --> 00:01:27.317
and technology.

00:01:27.317 --> 00:01:31.935
Develop a long-term vision and
appreciate strategy frameworks.

00:01:31.935 --> 00:01:32.619
Assess and

00:01:32.619 --> 00:01:38.252
enhance their personal leadership style to
be change-agents that drive innovation.

00:01:38.252 --> 00:01:40.743
And lead to cultural change
in their organizations.

00:01:40.743 --> 00:01:45.553
Here at Stanford they give you the best
of the best of what is happening in

00:01:45.553 --> 00:01:47.992
the world of finance and strategy.

00:01:47.992 --> 00:01:51.260
&gt;&gt; I'm going to take back a different
attitude, a different perspective.

00:01:51.260 --> 00:01:56.173
&gt;&gt; It's not only the professor's,
the lectures, the cases, but

00:01:56.173 --> 00:01:58.419
also the whole environment.

00:01:58.419 --> 00:02:02.386
&gt;&gt; The ECFO program has been
a fantastic opportunity for me.

00:02:02.386 --> 00:02:03.723
[MUSIC]

00:02:03.723 --> 00:02:06.638
This program is supporting me
in every way, not only me,

00:02:06.638 --> 00:02:08.413
it will support my organization.

00:02:08.413 --> 00:02:11.362
[MUSIC]

00:02:11.362 --> 00:02:12.556
&gt;&gt; It has been
a transformational experience.

00:02:12.556 --> 00:02:17.171
[MUSIC]

